---
import { ArrowLeft, Search } from 'lucide-react';
import AppShell from '@/layouts/AppShell.astro';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 | 泰拉百科" description="泰拉百科没有找到这个页面。">
  <AppShell>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-blue-600">404</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-slate-950">页面未找到</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
        这条档案可能尚未被整理，或链接已经变更。可以回到首页继续浏览，也可以使用搜索查找相关条目。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-600 bg-blue-600 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-blue-700"
        >
          <ArrowLeft aria-hidden="true" className="size-4" />
          返回首页
        </a>
        <a
          href="/search"
          class="inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition hover:border-blue-200 hover:text-blue-700"
        >
          <Search aria-hidden="true" className="size-4" />
          搜索条目
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </AppShell>
</BaseLayout>
